    "band_performance": {
      "Jerry": "Sweet, upfront vocals on most numbers; aggressive, bright guitar soloing especially on Truckin' and the second‑set jams, with a brief lead‑guitar loss in the encore but strong ballad playing on Brokedown Palace.",
